{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Peck peck peck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep pecking through endless dirt and uncover new underground biomes. Each layer brings new materials, weird characters, and strange surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/47e6d7c67725e77a4d7e02a7bc8aba0d.poster.avif?t=1763544302\" width=870 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/47e6d7c67725e77a4d7e02a7bc8aba0d.webm?t=1763544302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/47e6d7c67725e77a4d7e02a7bc8aba0d.mp4?t=1763544302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/1645975b18a333e6509e2b6c99843cbb.avif?t=1763544302\" width=907 height=664 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Excuse Me, One Gear Please!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From brave adventurers to clueless peasants, they all descend into your underground smithy. One wants heavy armor, another insists on something enchanted and oddly specific. You can\u2019t exactly say no, so you\u2019d better dig up the goods and hammer out whatever bizarre equipment they\u2019re asking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/d36f16a760107d2cd54cc8762a50fd23.poster.avif?t=1763544302\" width=864 height=564 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/d36f16a760107d2cd54cc8762a50fd23.webm?t=1763544302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/d36f16a760107d2cd54cc8762a50fd23.mp4?t=1763544302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Birdsmithing 101</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock recipes and forge questionable equipment to meet their demands. Craft a <strong>Tater Jerkin</strong> out of potatoes for crunchy fried protection\u2026 but will it actually help them survive long enough to share the loot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/7ff83a83b918150535e307b8da08d814.avif?t=1763544302\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras_big/7ff83a83b918150535e307b8da08d814.webp?t=1763544302 width=1560 height=509 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/1ed2d4e836f2dd881fe574ff6e879de8.poster.avif?t=1763544302\" width=1170 height=878 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/1ed2d4e836f2dd881fe574ff6e879de8.webm?t=1763544302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/1ed2d4e836f2dd881fe574ff6e879de8.mp4?t=1763544302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Encounters and Discoveries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is dirt and shinies. Discover odd encounters and make choices that leads to rewards or disasters. Do you peck open the mysterious box or leave it be? Do you rescue the goblin stuck under a boulder\u2026 or pretend you didn\u2019t see him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/017a99296b511be6acf0010fc1aa494d.avif?t=1763544302\" width=937 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/c69f39770c926100ccab5caf4a0af5d7.poster.avif?t=1763544302\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/c69f39770c926100ccab5caf4a0af5d7.webm?t=1763544302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/c69f39770c926100ccab5caf4a0af5d7.mp4?t=1763544302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/ef345fa56e85a69c16d9fabf130d564e.avif?t=1763544302\" width=828 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/d7a51db0c4b696c5a2675112afafd4dc.poster.avif?t=1763544302\" width=812 height=664 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/d7a51db0c4b696c5a2675112afafd4dc.webm?t=1763544302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060780/extras/d7a51db0c4b696c5a2675112afafd4dc.mp4?t=1763544302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idle in the corner!</strong></h2><p cla